# Toolchain sync runs FIRST, and here rather than only in the pre-push `check`.
# Its whole purpose is to catch that local lint/format/typecheck ran a different
# tool version than the lockfile CI installs — and `lint-staged` below is exactly
# that local run. Discovering the drift at pre-push means a batch of commits has
# already been reformatted by the wrong prettier (the 2026-07-01 near-miss). It
# reads two files and costs well under a second, so it belongs on every commit.
pnpm run toolchain:check
pnpm lint-staged